<c:Symbols>
<o:NoteSymbol Id="o6">
<a:Text>A rule is necessary to make sure that each season of a competition can have only one winner.</a:Text>
<a:CreationDate>1763319778</a:CreationDate>
<a:ModificationDate>1763319778</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Rect>((29802,20013), (38026,13521))</a:Rect>
<a:TextStyle>4130</a:TextStyle>
<a:AutoAdjustToText>0</a:AutoAdjustToText>
<a:LineColor>16711680</a:LineColor>
<a:FillColor>16777215</a:FillColor>
<a:ShadowColor>12632256</a:ShadowColor>
<a:FontName>Arial,8,N</a:FontName>
<a:ManuallyResized>1</a:ManuallyResized>
</o:NoteSymbol>
<o:NoteSymbol Id="o7">
<a:Text>The actual manager is redundant but it was added to make it easily accessed in the Clubs table but mostly to generate the need to implement consistency rules between Clubs and ClubManager.</a:Text>
<a:CreationDate>1763319778</a:CreationDate>
<a:ModificationDate>1763319778</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Rect>((-22400,39200), (-8000,32800))</a:Rect>
<a:TextStyle>4130</a:TextStyle>
<a:AutoAdjustToText>0</a:AutoAdjustToText>
<a:LineColor>16711680</a:LineColor>
<a:FillColor>16777215</a:FillColor>
<a:ShadowColor>12632256</a:ShadowColor>
<a:FontName>Arial,8,N</a:FontName>
<a:ManuallyResized>1</a:ManuallyResized>
</o:NoteSymbol>
<o:NoteSymbol Id="o8">
<a:Text>A rule is necessary to make sure Actual Manager of a club is consistent with the ClubManager record. Also, whenever the ClubManager is updated the Actual Manager should be updated accordingly.</a:Text>
<a:CreationDate>1763319778</a:CreationDate>
<a:ModificationDate>1763319778</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Rect>((22912,51999), (38820,45959))</a:Rect>
<a:TextStyle>4130</a:TextStyle>
<a:AutoAdjustToText>0</a:AutoAdjustToText>
<a:LineColor>16711680</a:LineColor>
<a:FillColor>16777215</a:FillColor>
<a:ShadowColor>12632256</a:ShadowColor>
<a:FontName>Arial,8,N</a:FontName>
<a:ManuallyResized>1</a:ManuallyResized>
</o:NoteSymbol>
<o:NoteSymbol Id="o9">
<a:Text>The actual club of a player is not explicitly stored as it can be obtained by querying transfers and clubs using transfer dates. A view can be built with this information: Players + Actual Club. Another view can be build with the players playing in each club: Club + Actual Players.</a:Text>
<a:CreationDate>1763319778</a:CreationDate>
<a:ModificationDate>1763319778</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Rect>((-53107,68799), (-35179,61057))</a:Rect>
<a:TextStyle>4130</a:TextStyle>
<a:AutoAdjustToText>0</a:AutoAdjustToText>
<a:LineColor>16711680</a:LineColor>
<a:FillColor>16777215</a:FillColor>
<a:ShadowColor>12632256</a:ShadowColor>
<a:FontName>Arial,8,N</a:FontName>
<a:ManuallyResized>1</a:ManuallyResized>
</o:NoteSymbol>
<o:NoteSymbol Id="o10">
<a:Text>A rule is necessary to make sure that player, club and match are consistent with the clubs participating in a match and also the actual players of a club.</a:Text>
<a:CreationDate>1763319778</a:CreationDate>
<a:ModificationDate>1763319778</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Rect>((-85600,33738), (-75652,25600))</a:Rect>
<a:TextStyle>4130</a:TextStyle>
<a:AutoAdjustToText>0</a:AutoAdjustToText>
